    "Scouting Notes": "Starter?\n Interesting delivery, somewhat hunched over into his leg lift but very explosive and gets his legs into the delivery really well\n Stuff looks legit for an 18 year old\n Fastball up to 97 already and sitting more 93 95 with some life on it, looks to really pop the mitt\n Slider spins a lot and sits in the mid 80's with late break. Best secondary for him presently.\n Changeup doesn't take a ton of velo off (around 89 90 MPH) but does have some late break and when it's down it looks like a potentially fringe average pitch\n Starter traits here with big velo for his age. If he was drafted as a HS draft pick, he'd be a $350k bonus or higher guy",
